HPACK test stories (test data only; not part of the library)

Origin
- Copied unchanged from h2 0.4.19, directory fixtures/hpack/ (https://github.com/hyperium/h2),
  which vendors hpack-test-case (https://github.com/http2jp/hpack-test-case) by the http2jp
  project. The header data were converted from https://github.com/http2/http_samples (see
  README.md).
- The encoder-output directories were produced by the named HPACK implementations (go-hpack,
  haskell-http2, nghttp2, node-http2-hpack, python-hpack); raw-data holds the original header
  sets without wire encodings.
